#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This example demonstrates the effect an ABS system can have while braking on a split-mu surface.
#
#The B-Class Hatchback uses a CarSim ABS system. More information can be found by browsing to the Vehicle: Assembly screen and clicking the blue link for the brake system "B-Class, Hatchback w/ ABS".
#
#For comparison, this simulation is overlaid with another example, "Braking - Split Mu: No ABS". That example has the same B-Class Hatchback as this example, but the braking system does not use any ABS system.
#
#Review the plots and animation to see the difference an ABS system can have on a vehicle performing a straight-line split-mu stop.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

